Unibus/Omnibus Receivers, extended single
<UL>
<LI><b>M784bad</b> is a version of the M784 that won't work.</LI>
<LI><b>M784</b> is basically DEC's version of the M784 Bus Receivers module,
using the now hard to find SP380.</LI>
<LI><b>M784new</b> is a version of DEC's M784 Bus Receivers module using the 
AM26S10 instead of the SP380.</LI>
